			dependencies: ["5D4499D4254102B7"]
			description: [
				"Carrying all sorts of food in my pocket is quite cumbersome. I should make some sort of basket to store my food in. This may, I can regain my strength with various kinds of food without taking up much space."
				""
				"&a(Use the left mouse button with the basket in hand to switch modes. In open mode, the basket functions like a bundle with 5 slots for food. In closed mode, you can select what food to eat. You must set it back to open mode to eat the food you selected. The basket then behaves as a normal food item, eating with right click.)"
